          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E Yehova wacu ni Musa kumae, Gor lembe maeni: kum atimo lembariba kudi man kud Israel calku lembe maeni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 34:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man ebedo kuca karacelo ku Yehova ceng’ pier ang’wen man diewor pier ang’wen; ecamu kwen de ngo, kadok madhu pi de ngo. Man egoro lembe mi lembariba wi ban, en e lembang’ola apar.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
